  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Instruction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This cable enables the integration of multiple electronic devices to a single 14500 7.4V 800mAh Li-ion Battery, facilitating a more compact power supply setup."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Important Notices"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Current capacity: When using this Y-type splitter cable to connect two devices, ensure that the total current draw does not exceed the maximum output capacity of the power source."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Voltage compatibility: Verify that both connected devices share the same voltage requirements, as this cable provides parallel power/signal distribution."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Choking hazard: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Instruction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p>This cable enables the integration of multiple electronic devices to a single <span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><a href=\"../../products/14500-7-4v-800mah-li-ion-battery-1pcs\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42; text-decoration: underline;\" target=\"_blank\">14500 7.4V 800mAh Li-ion Battery</a></strong></span>, facilitating a more compact power supply setup.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 78px;\"><!-- 物品清单布局 --><!-- 标题加文案结束 --> <!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"height: 55px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; height: 55px; width: 102.611px; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>Product ID</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 55px; width: 166.056px; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>Connector Model</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 55px; width: 118.611px; padding: 10px !important;\">Length(mm)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 55px; width: 206.403px; padding: 10px !important;\">Outer Diameter (mm)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 55px; width: 112.236px; padding: 10px !important;\">Wire Gauge</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; height: 23px; width: 102.611px; padding: 10px !important;\">PD003</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 23px; width: 166.056px; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\">XH2.54 Male - Dual XH2.54 Female</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 23px; width: 118.611px; padding: 10px !important;\">50</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 23px; width: 206.403px; padding: 10px !important;\">1.1</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 23px; width: 112.236px; padding: 10px !important;\">24AWG</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\">Important Notices</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Current capacity</strong>: When using this Y-type splitter cable to connect two devices, ensure that the total current draw does not exceed the maximum output capacity of the power source.</li>\n<li><strong>Voltage compatibility</strong>: Verify that both connected devices share the same voltage requirements, as this cable provides parallel power/signal distribution.</li>\n<li><strong>Choking hazard</strong>: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "This cable enables the integration of multiple electronic devices to a single 14500 7.4V 800mAh Li-ion Battery, facilitating a more compact power supply setup.\n\nCurrent capacity: When using this Y-type splitter cable to connect two devices, ensure that the total current draw does not exceed the maximum output capacity of the power source.\n\nVoltage compatibility: Verify that both connected devices share the same voltage requirements, as this cable provides parallel power/signal distribution.\n\nChoking hazard: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.",
